{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo level showing gameplay aspects of Absum,\u00a0 This demo features a full level area of the full game which may change or be added to based on player feedback before full game release.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> \u2013 Explore a house that twists and changes as you search its halls and hidden rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 A slow, unsettling descent where reality bends and paranoia takes hold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragmented Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Notes, objects, and whispers reveal pieces of the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Design</strong> \u2013 Dark visuals and creepy soundscapes keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epileptic seizures associated with increased sensitivity to light are Possible. Some people may experience seizures when exposed to flashes of light and flashing images that appear in a video game. People who have not previously experienced such attacks may not be aware of their illness. A reasonable restriction of the game audience is recommended</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032850?t=1758673596","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032850?t=1758673596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032850/cb1261c302d7d9d9852ffd1f0ebf2ddc7a4a8b37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758673596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032850/cb1261c302d7d9d9852ffd1f0ebf2ddc7a4a8b37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758673596","categories":[{"description":"Sing